 "text": "Register of Deeds - Charles Mix County, South Dakota\nOctober 18, 2026\nCharles Mix County, South Dakota\nHome\nAgenda/Minutes »\n2026\n2025\n2024\n2023\n2022\n2021\n2020\n2019\nHistorical Minutes\nClosed\nDirectory »\nAuditor/Elections\nClerk of Courts\nCommission\nCommunity Health Nurse & WIC Program\nCourthouse Officials\nDirector of Equalization\nEmergency Management\nExtension and 4-H\nGIS\nHighway Department\nRegister of Deeds\nSheriff\nState’s Attorney\nTreasurer\nVeteran Services\nWelfare Office\nWeed & Pest\nEmployment\nForms\nNotices »\nPublic Notices\nCounty Ordinances\nTownships\nYou are here: Home / Register of Deeds\nRegister of Deeds\nThe county Register of Deeds issues and/or files marriage licenses, birth and death certificates, burial permits, real estate transactions (including deeds, mortgages and mortgage transfers), federal and state tax liens, state unemployment tax liens, military discharge records, and business name registrations. The Register of Deeds is also responsible for recording all liens, survey plat certificates and county welfare liens. The Register of Deeds is the official county record keeper.\nPO Box 70\nLake Andes, SD 57356\n(605) 487-7141\nFax: (605) 487-7221\nJulie Pavel, Register of Deeds – jpavel@charlesmixcounty.gov\n** We now accept E-Recording**\nhttps://simplifile.com/\nPRINTABLE FORMS\nSD Vital Records Request\nSD BIRTH REQUEST ADDENDUM\nCERTIFICATE FICTITIOUS NAME\nMILITARY DISCHARGE RELEASE\nCertificate of Real Estate Value\nCertification Owner Occupied Dwelling\nCertification of Contractor Owner Occupied Dwelling\nRECORDING INFORMATION FOR REAL ESTATE DOCUMENTS\n43.28.24 PERSONALLY IDENTIFIABLE INFORMATION\n7-9-1 PREPARERS INFORMATION\n7-9-7 DOCS COMPLETE ADDRESSES\n43-4-22 EXEMPTIONS FROM TRANSFER FEE\n43-28-23 FORMAT STANDARDS\nREGISTER OF DEED FEES\nFEES\nCheck out the all new Charles Mix County Land Information Database\nFor the most up to date property valuation and tax status, contact the County.\nNews\nReturn to top of page\nCopyright © 2026 on Genesis Framework · WordPress · Log in",
